{"unit_id":"ethanchen669__dsh-energy-orb#card-zh","repo":"ethanchen669/dsh-energy-orb","commit":"8bd3bc07d87bd0d9d3f8e4724554a462dbc26b8a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Energy Orb 是面向 DSH Web GUI 的会话状态可视化插件。它把悬浮组件接入 shell.overlay，并读取会话运行状态，让能量球在空闲时收敛静止、运行时以心跳和旋转呈现活动。用户可以点击触发脉冲、拖动或折叠组件，并保存显示偏好；系统也尊重减少动态效果设置，在 WebGL 不可用时提供 CSS 球体回退。适合希望在界面中直观看到当前会话是否运行的 DSH Web 用户。需要宿主提供 webServer 与会话状态事件；不需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:734-742","client.js:145-179","client.js:449-462","client.js:267-304","client.js:336-362"]}
{"unit_id":"ethanchen669__dsh-energy-orb#card-en","repo":"ethanchen669/dsh-energy-orb","commit":"8bd3bc07d87bd0d9d3f8e4724554a462dbc26b8a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Energy Orb adds a floating orb to DSH Web showing whether the current session is idle or running. It pulses during activity; drag, collapse or click to pulse. Preferences persist locally, with a CSS fallback without WebGL. Requires host session events and webServer; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:734-742","client.js:145-179","client.js:449-462","client.js:267-304","client.js:336-362"]}
