{"unit_id":"ethanchen669__dsh-energy-orb#feature-1","repo":"ethanchen669/dsh-energy-orb","commit":"8bd3bc07d87bd0d9d3f8e4724554a462dbc26b8a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Energy Orb 的功能「会话状态球」：组件读取当前会话的运行状态，空闲时球体静止收缩，回合运行时增强亮度并以心跳和旋转动画提示活动。状态陈旧时按空闲显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:145-179","client.js:164-172"]}
{"unit_id":"ethanchen669__dsh-energy-orb#feature-2","repo":"ethanchen669/dsh-energy-orb","commit":"8bd3bc07d87bd0d9d3f8e4724554a462dbc26b8a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Energy Orb 的功能「悬浮球交互」：在界面中的能量球可点击触发一次能量脉冲，也能拖动改变位置、折叠成小把手或重新展开；显示和位置偏好会保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:449-462","client.js:566-603","client.js:72-80"]}
{"unit_id":"ethanchen669__dsh-energy-orb#feature-3","repo":"ethanchen669/dsh-energy-orb","commit":"8bd3bc07d87bd0d9d3f8e4724554a462dbc26b8a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Energy Orb 的功能「渲染回退」：加载球体模块失败或 WebGL 不可用时，界面改用 CSS 绘制的降级球体；用户仍可看到状态提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:336-362","client.js:685-703"]}
